"Berber" means nothing special.
Just 3779+5*30*10=5279
Berber has currently 5213 sentences. Therefore, I say that we can surpass 
Berber. But it could be any other language.
As for Klingon it's really sad that Lojban, the language open community 
(unlike Klingon which is said to be owned by some company, may be 
Paramount) has still fewer sentences than Klingon.

